<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-19T13:38:42.814Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 13:38:42 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Bandits attacked a mining site in Plateau, killing three people, and carried out another attack in Plateau that left nine dead. The Nigerian army met with bandits in Kwara, and a video of the encounter was later clarified as surrender talks rather than fraternisation, while a separate viral video showed soldiers interacting with armed bandits. U.S. officials praised Nigeria for rescuing 125 kidnapping victims and dismantling terrorist camps, and Nigerian forces killed 21 ISWAP fighters in Borno. Police are searching for the family of a Canadian-Nigerian man killed in a road crash near Lagos Airport. The conflict recorded 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxQZHZtS2o0TmlBMU9TVTloWGEwS3UySlZpQVhrVVQyenRWdWZEeVZ2bHhFUnFYNFppTTZ3aGdmR1g0NEZQajJhN19MRjJaQTRkU0JTZE9VRmFqa04yN0ZFRlNwLUhOeTUtR3B2MWN1R0lFcWpZMEFadGFsbmczcl9pNkdwZkpfQ0tMUFE5Qm1hU3Fac1BkdEprcFV3TmVDaXYzbXBBdm9xZnpyV2dYZG8zMk9CQXhMNXM?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxNRVg0aXlnWTRHdk81aU1LbThMMktiemtaa0hfRnk4bFdlZWs5aUVYVjlhMGVXVjZQOXNraWNRTGFGMTNFTlJ3aVFwWGUzREphRDRnNlljVE5xZmFkSlVrMDVSOTZ0V2R1VzNfSTNtcU91eEhNeU5teDVuM2JBLVFCaHppNA?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxQTS1LSGlyR0FqZUpPSFQwME9xWWtfd0QwaVlzckY3eVBnR1lqQXdSUm14VjMwYVI3WXIxRXRMUm0xVTFVOVU3MG05SGJITjBCd2pDaXFPUDE4RzhOQ21qcGZySmhxSHEzM2NkdW1ZTDViYnRvSEJJZVBVTWp6cVNEQkJlR3VNN3hRT3Q1M0w3RWt6R2NvaEhPaUk0blllNWZzZ2Z4MlBkTQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Barnabas Aid&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxQUnVhcWJTc0Z2My05bDVRcjdEaVVjdDNQRmhmRGZzQVVaTHVENzU0bk9hNUl6U1R0dXBkcVdxWDEwRXF6X05YX1Fycm94d0xyNWw0dGREcHUzcV9CVV